Evergreen-Patch: register-evergreen-component
Why: Builds browser/components/evergreen (Evergreen's UI and startup code,
  added by the src/ overlay). Everything else Evergreen registers -- window
  hooks, startup hooks, default prefs -- comes from that directory's own
  moz.build and Evergreen.manifest, so this is the only upstream line needed
  to load Evergreen.
Upstream: not upstreamable (Evergreen-specific)
Drop-when: never; this is Evergreen's entry point
Owner: Evergreen maintainers

--- a/browser/components/moz.build
+++ b/browser/components/moz.build
@@ -39,6 +39,7 @@
     "customkeys",
     "downloads",
     "enterprisepolicies",
+    "evergreen",
     "extensions",
     "firefoxview",
     "genai",
